# CBMC 5.12

This release includes fix and improve simplifier debug output (via #3651), fix
simplification of logical right shift of signed bitvectors (via #3701), and test
signed left-shift overflow for C99 (via #3710). It also includes 1408 further
changes.

## What's Changed
