# CBMC 5.6

This release includes enable JAR file support for goto-diff (via #215), add
option to cbmc for nondet static initialization (via #266), and fix typecast
array access (via #228). It also includes 28 further changes.

## What's Changed
* Test inputs and outputs for C and Java by @peterschrammel in https://github.com/diffblue/cbmc/pull/207
